Z||000000||Indy-2M4||11-24-2001||08:44 AM||||Oh, God! Okay, I'm ready to be commited. This is my 2nd Fiero purchase in just 2 months and I think the family is ready to commit me. I can't help it. I've been wanting a GT and I finally got it. I've had my eye on this car ever since the guy got it new. About a month ago, I saw it backed up in the driveway like it was getting ready to go up for sale. I slipped a club card under the wipers. Came back by an hour later and the sucker had a For Sale sign in the window. Well after hooo humming around and driving past it almost everyday, I approached the guy on the phone asking questions. Well Thanksgiving Day, I couldn't take it anymore (loosing sleep and Sh**), drove it and came home with it. She is a beautiful Burgandy/Silver '87 and is going to be my daily driver. This guy has used it as his daily since he's had it, but you sure as hell can't tell it. Had to get this out...thanks for listening. Oh God...whos that in the driveway??? Oh, Lord....white coats...bye, bye!<P>------------------<BR><BR>F.K.A. KathyHL<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://sofa.iwarp.com/IndyFiero2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
