Z||000003||Back On Holiday||11-25-2001||07:58 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Indy-2M4:<BR><B>Just went out and did a photo shoot of the Lewis Fiero Family. I'm currently downloading them to the computer now and hope to have them posted later tonight. <P>Kat</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's funny, That's what we call our Fieros.<BR>The Lewis Fiero Family...<P>(my pops)Ed Lewis - 85se 2m6 Silver auto<BR>(me)Andrew Lewis - 84se 2m4 Silver 4speed<BR>(wife)Barbie Lewis - 86se 2m6 Silver 4speed<P>Well, the 86 is really mine..but she WANTS to drive it to carlisle next year while I drive the 84<P>Andrew Lewis<BR>||||reg||1
